      "content": "wait 200mg again?? that seems like a lot. i'm also kinda getting a little dizzy and my heart feels like it's racing really fast. i'm scared. are you sure i don't need to go to the er now? i'm worried the benadryl won't work fast enough if my throat keeps getting tighter.",
